{%- comment -%}
  Hartwick Atelier — the binder rings on the homepage opening.

  Aloha's artboard binds the two hero photographs like the pages of a
  scrapbook: two rings pass through punched holes either side of the seam,
  positioned by CSS at a quarter and three-quarters of the height (the
  artboard's 186 and 572 on a 769 frame). On a phone the frames stack and
  the rings turn with the seam.

  The ring is Aloha's own artwork (24 September 2026: "whenever we have
  rings on our page, please just use these"), assets/ha-ring.svg, holes
  included. The same ring stands upright on the binding bars
  (assets/ha-ring-upright.svg). Both are her PNG inside an SVG, because the
  CDN re-encodes a PNG asset as lossy AVIF.

  Decorative only: aria-hidden, empty alt.

  Usage: {% render 'ha-home-rings' %}
{%- endcomment -%}

<span class="ha-home-hero__rings" aria-hidden="true">
  {%- for i in (1..2) -%}
    <img class="ha-home-hero__ring ha-home-hero__ring--{{ i }}" src="{{ 'ha-ring.svg' | asset_url }}" width="290" height="55" alt="" loading="eager">
  {%- endfor -%}
</span>
